{"seq":1,"slug":"pattern-matching-du","title":"模式匹配与可区分联合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/fsharp-functional-dotnet/functional/pattern-matching-du","wordCount":1295,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"模式匹配与可区分联合\">模式匹配与可区分联合</h1><p>如果只能保留 F# 的一个特性，很多人会选可区分联合配模式匹配。可区分联合（discriminated union，DU）让你用类型直接说出「这个值要么是这个，要么是那个」；模式匹配让你在使用端把它拆开，而且编译器会盯着你有没有漏掉某种情况。这一对组合是 F# 描述「数据有哪几种形态」的根本工具，也是后面<a href=\"../applications/domain-modeling\">函数式领域建模</a>把业务规则编码进类型的理论基石。本篇讲清 DU 怎么定义、模式匹配的各种形态、以及穷尽性检查为什么是它最值钱的特性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可区分联合是「和类型」：一个 <code>Shape</code> 类型的值是圆、矩形、三角形三者之一，但同一时刻只能是其中一种。模式匹配是它的对偶——按值的实际形态分派到对应分支，并在分派的同时解构出内部数据。两者的契约由编译器的<strong>穷尽性检查</strong>守护：少写一个分支，编译器就警告你。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[可区分联合 DU] --&gt; B[每个 case 可携带数据]&#10;  A --&gt; C[同时只是一种 case]&#10;  D[模式匹配 match] --&gt; E[按 case 分派]&#10;  E --&gt; F[解构内部数据]&#10;  D --&gt; G[穷尽性检查]&#10;  G --&gt; H{覆盖所有 case?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[编译器警告]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J[安全]&#10;  A --&gt; D\">graph TD\n  A[可区分联合 DU] --&gt; B[每个 case 可携带数据]\n  A --&gt; C[同时只是一种 case]\n  D[模式匹配 match] --&gt; E[按 case 分派]\n  E --&gt; F[解构内部数据]\n  D --&gt; G[穷尽性检查]\n  G --&gt; H{覆盖所有 case?}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[编译器警告]\n  H --&gt;|是| J[安全]\n  A --&gt; D</pre><p>下表对比 DU 与其他建模手段在表达「多选一」上的差异。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>表达「多选一」</th>\n<th>携带各异数据</th>\n<th>穷尽性检查</th>\n<th>评价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可区分联合</td>\n<td>直接、类型级</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>F# 首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>枚举 enum</td>\n<td>仅整数标签</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>仅适合纯标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类继承层级</td>\n<td>可，靠多态</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>无（开放）</td>\n<td>OO 思路，冗长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串/标志位</td>\n<td>约定俗成</td>\n<td>手工塞</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>易错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"定义可区分联合\">定义可区分联合</h2><p>DU 用 <code>type</code> 加竖线分隔的 case 定义，每个 case 可以携带零个或多个数据，也可以给字段命名。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"fsharp\" data-code=\"type Shape =&#10;    | Circle of radius: float&#10;    | Rectangle of width: float * height: float&#10;    | Triangle of baseLen: float * height: float&#10;&#10;type PaymentMethod =&#10;    | Cash&#10;    | Card of number: string&#10;    | Wallet of provider: string * id: string\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type Shape =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Circle of radius: float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Rectangle of width: float * height: float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Triangle of baseLen: float * height: float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type PaymentMethod =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Cash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Card of number: string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Wallet of provider: string * id: string</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DU 可以是递归的，这让它天然适合表达树状结构——这也是为什么编译器、解释器、JSON 模型几乎都用 DU 来表示语法树或文档结构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"fsharp\" data-code=\"type Json =&#10;    | JNull&#10;    | JBool of bool&#10;    | JNumber of float&#10;    | JString of string&#10;    | JArray of Json list&#10;    | JObject of (string * Json) list\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type Json =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | JNull</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | JBool of bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | JNumber of float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | JString of string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | JArray of Json list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | JObject of (string * Json) list</span></span></code></pre></div><p>单 case DU 是一个常被忽视但极有用的模式：<code>type CustomerId = CustomerId of int</code> 把一个裸 <code>int</code> 包装成有语义的类型，让 <code>CustomerId</code> 和 <code>OrderId</code> 即使底层都是 <code>int</code> 也不能互相混用。这种轻量包装是领域建模里的常客，详见<a href=\"../applications/domain-modeling\">函数式领域建模</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模式匹配的形态\">模式匹配的形态</h2><p><code>match ... with</code> 按值的形态分派，每个分支用一个模式，命中即解构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"fsharp\" data-code=\"let area shape =&#10;    match shape with&#10;    | Circle r -&gt; System.Math.PI * r * r&#10;    | Rectangle (w, h) -&gt; w * h&#10;    | Triangle (b, h) -&gt; 0.5 * b * h\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let area shape =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match shape with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Circle r -> System.Math.PI * r * r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Rectangle (w, h) -> w * h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Triangle (b, h) -> 0.5 * b * h</span></span></code></pre></div><p>圆面积这里用到的公式是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\pi r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，矩形是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = wh</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，三角形是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\frac{1}{2}bh</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">bh</span></span></span></span></span>——模式匹配让每个分支只关心自己那种形态的数据。模式不止用于 DU，它能解构元组、记录、列表，能匹配字面量，能用 <code>when</code> 加守卫条件，能用 <code>|</code> 合并分支，能用 <code>_</code> 兜底。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"fsharp\" data-code=\"let describe input =&#10;    match input with&#10;    | (0, 0) -&gt; &quot;原点&quot;&#10;    | (x, 0) -&gt; sprintf &quot;x 轴上 x=%d&quot; x&#10;    | (0, y) -&gt; sprintf &quot;y 轴上 y=%d&quot; y&#10;    | (x, y) when x = y -&gt; &quot;对角线&quot;&#10;    | _ -&gt; &quot;一般点&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let describe input =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match input with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | (0, 0) -> \"原点\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | (x, 0) -> sprintf \"x 轴上 x=%d\" x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | (0, y) -> sprintf \"y 轴上 y=%d\" y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | (x, y) when x = y -> \"对角线\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | _ -> \"一般点\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>列表的 <code>head :: tail</code> 模式让递归处理列表变得直观，这是函数式集合操作的根基。模式匹配作为表达式（见<a href=\"../foundations/fsharp-philosophy\">设计哲学里的表达式优先</a>），整个 <code>match</code> 会求值出一个统一类型的结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"穷尽性检查-最值钱的保证\">穷尽性检查：最值钱的保证</h2><p>模式匹配真正的杀手锏不是语法简洁，而是<strong>穷尽性检查</strong>。当你 <code>match</code> 一个 DU 却漏掉某个 case，编译器会发出「未覆盖以下模式」的警告。于是当你给 <code>Shape</code> 新增一个 <code>Ellipse</code> case，所有匹配 <code>Shape</code> 的地方都会立刻在编译期亮红，逼你去补齐处理逻辑——而不是等到运行时某个分支静默走了错误的兜底。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"fsharp\" data-code=\"// 若新增 case 而此处未更新，编译器警告 incomplete match&#10;let name shape =&#10;    match shape with&#10;    | Circle _ -&gt; &quot;圆&quot;&#10;    | Rectangle _ -&gt; &quot;矩形&quot;&#10;    | Triangle _ -&gt; &quot;三角形&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 若新增 case 而此处未更新，编译器警告 incomplete match</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let name shape =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match shape with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Circle _ -> \"圆\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Rectangle _ -> \"矩形\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Triangle _ -> \"三角形\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这把「加了新情况却忘了处理」这一类极常见的维护 bug，从运行时崩溃前移成编译期警告。正因如此，资深 F# 程序员会刻意避免用 <code>_</code> 通配兜底 DU——通配会吞掉穷尽性检查的价值，让编译器以为你已处理所有情况。穷尽性 + DU 是 F# 让重构变得安全的核心机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"活动模式-让匹配可扩展\">活动模式：让匹配可扩展</h2><p>内置模式只能匹配 DU 和基础结构。活动模式（active patterns）让你自定义「匹配逻辑」，把任意值变换成可匹配的形态，从而对 .NET 对象、正则、复杂条件也能用模式匹配的语法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"fsharp\" data-code=\"let (|Even|Odd|) n = if n % 2 = 0 then Even else Odd&#10;&#10;let parity n =&#10;    match n with&#10;    | Even -&gt; &quot;偶&quot;&#10;    | Odd -&gt; &quot;奇&quot;&#10;&#10;// 部分活动模式：用 Option 表示「可能不匹配」&#10;let (|Int|_|) (s: string) =&#10;    match System.Int32.TryParse s with&#10;    | true, v -&gt; Some v&#10;    | false, _ -&gt; None\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let (|Even|Odd|) n = if n % 2 = 0 then Even else Odd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let parity n =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match n with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Even -> \"偶\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Odd -> \"奇\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 部分活动模式：用 Option 表示「可能不匹配」</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let (|Int|_|) (s: string) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match System.Int32.TryParse s with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | true, v -> Some v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | false, _ -> None</span></span></code></pre></div><p>活动模式弥合了 DU 的封闭性和现实数据的多样性：它让你在不暴露内部表示的前提下提供匹配能力，也让消费 <a href=\"../dotnet/dotnet-interop\">C# 类型</a>时能用上 F# 优雅的匹配语法。它本质上是把「判别 + 解构」的逻辑抽成一个可命名、可复用的模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可区分联合是和类型，用类型直接表达「多选一」，每个 case 可携带各异的数据，并支持递归（适合树/语法树）。</li>\n<li>单 case DU 用于给裸类型加语义，是领域建模的常用轻量包装。</li>\n<li>模式匹配按形态分派并同时解构，可作用于 DU、元组、记录、列表、字面量，支持 <code>when</code> 守卫与分支合并。</li>\n<li>穷尽性检查是最值钱的特性：漏 case 会编译期警告，使新增情况后的重构变得安全；应避免用 <code>_</code> 兜底 DU。</li>\n<li>活动模式让模式匹配可扩展到任意值与 .NET 对象，弥合 DU 封闭性与现实数据多样性。</li>\n<li>这套机制是<a href=\"../applications/domain-modeling\">函数式领域建模</a>的理论基石，也与<a href=\"railway-error-handling\">铁路式错误处理</a>的 <code>Result</code> 匹配紧密相关。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模式匹配与可区分联合","id":"模式匹配与可区分联合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"定义可区分联合","id":"定义可区分联合"},{"level":2,"text":"模式匹配的形态","id":"模式匹配的形态"},{"level":2,"text":"穷尽性检查：最值钱的保证","id":"穷尽性检查-最值钱的保证"},{"level":2,"text":"活动模式：让匹配可扩展","id":"活动模式-让匹配可扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"函数与不可变性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/fsharp-functional-dotnet/foundations/functions-immutability"},"next":{"title":"计算表达式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/fsharp-functional-dotnet/functional/computation-expressions"}}